# Core project rules

- Read root `AGENTS.md`, `RULES.md`, and `ARCHITECTURE.md` before large changes.
- Local-first GGUF chat; do not require cloud LLM for text.
- Voice is Mode V: host `voice_runtime` (Whisper + Kokoro) + Flutter PTT — no Gemini Live / Fish Docker.
- No secrets, `.gguf`, or voice weights in git.
- Smallest diff; match GetX + Hive patterns; no second state framework.
- Voice BE work belongs in `voice_runtime/` (Mode V, macOS-first — see ROADMAP.md).
